msgid ""
" Its home screen tile's folder was deleted: if the tile is still on the "
"home screen, delete it there."
msgstr ""
" Folder jej kafelka na ekranie głównym usunięto: jeśli kafelek nadal tam "
"jest, usuń go na ekranie głównym."

